@startuml CU02_Gestionar_Planes
title Diagrama de Comunicación / Robustez ICONIX - CU02: Gestionar Planes y Límites

top to bottom direction
skinparam actorStyle hollow
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10

actor ":Superadmin" as Act

package "Frontend (Angular PWA)" {
  boundary ":TenantsPageComponent" as Page
  boundary ":SubscriptionModalComponent" as Modal
  boundary ":CompanyService" as Srv
}

package "Backend (FastAPI)" {
  control ":PlanRoutes" as PlanR
  control ":SubscriptionRoutes" as SubR
  control ":QuotaService" as Quota
  
  entity ":Company" as EntComp
  entity ":Plan" as EntPlan
  entity ":Subscription" as EntSub
  entity ":Branch" as EntBranch
}

' -------------------------------------------------------------
' ENLACES Y MENSAJES DE COMUNICACIÓN
' -------------------------------------------------------------

' 1. Actor <--> Frontend
Act --> Page : 1: openSubscriptionModal()
Page --> Modal : 1.1: loadData()\n2.10: onSubscriptionUpdated()
Act --> Modal : 2: onSubmit()\n3: onSubmit()
Modal --> Act : 3.5: showErrorToast()

' 2. Frontend Boundaries
Modal --> Srv : 1.2: getPlans()\n1.5: getCompanySubscription()\n2.1: assignSubscription()\n3.1: assignSubscription()

' 3. Frontend <--> Backend Routes
Srv --> PlanR : 1.3: list_plans()
PlanR --> EntPlan : 1.4: query()

Srv --> SubR : 1.6: get_company_subscription()\n2.2: assign_subscription()\n2.9: response()\n3.2: assign_subscription()\n3.4: raise_http_exception()

' 4. Backend Routes <--> Entities & Services
SubR --> EntComp : 2.3: query()
SubR --> EntPlan : 2.4: query()

SubR --> Quota : 1.7: get_active_subscription()\n2.5: validate_branch_quota()\n3.3: validate_branch_quota()

' 5. SELF-LOOP (Validación interna en QuotaService)
Quota --> Quota : 2.5: validate_branch_quota() [OK: sucursales <= max_branches]\n3.3: validate_branch_quota() [FAIL: sucursales > max_branches]

' 6. Queries y Persistencia
Quota --> EntSub : 1.8: query()
Quota --> EntBranch : 2.6: query() [conteo sucursales activas]

SubR --> EntSub : 2.7: update() [marca CANCELADA]\n2.8: create() [nueva ACTIVA]

@enduml
